         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nSun Tzu (孙子) was a Chinese strategist. In *The Art of War*, he presents five factors to consider before acting: the law of morale, heaven, terrain, the commander, and method and discipline.\n\nIn this class, you will use these five factors as a strategy for learning subtraction. Each factor has its own screen.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
