         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Heaven\n\nVisualize the numbers you are subtracting with your own body. Every time you subtract one number from another, check whether the result stays within the count of your fingers or goes beyond it. Then try to recreate the subtractions you are doing here in other scenarios, so you realize that the same idea appears everywhere.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
